; --- Vellvm mem-scan: a borrowed field's last read moved into a class method.

; --- A class's concept printed after the struct whose template uses it.

; --- Vellvm with global Set Crane Loopify: a frame-stack loop's result
; default-constructed at a type (itree) that has no default constructor.

; --- Vellvm with global Set Crane Loopify: a non-recursive instance method
; that calls the inner instance's same-named method is loopified.

; --- Vellvm with global Set Crane Loopify: mutually recursive functions with
; different result types share one frame-stack _result.

; --- Vellvm with global Set Crane Loopify: a resume frame's continuation field
; typed as decltype of a lambda expression.

; --- Vellvm with global Set Crane Loopify: polymorphic mutual traversal with
; class and function parameters and a partially applied partner.

; --- Stage A: an immediately invoked [=] lambda matching an owned capture.

; --- A local fix captured by reference escapes through a state-monad bind.

